  "prefLabel": "Site 102.29 Natural community",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.29 “Natural community” means “natural community” as defined in RSA 217-A:3, XI, namely, “a recurring assemblage of plants and animals found in a particular physical environment.”\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
